  "description": "ISSN Barcode Reader using PDF library C# sample code: The nuget package includes detailed C# source code to read, scan ISSN barcode from PDF file in ASP.NET, MVC, web, Windows applications.\n\nBarcode Input Types :\n* Document : Adobe PDF (.pdf)\n* Raster images: BITMAP (.bmp), JPEG, PNG, TIFF, GIF\n* Stream objects or Byte array\n\nCompatible with :\n* .NET Standard 2.0\n* .NET 8, .NET 7, .NET 6, .NET 5\n* .NET Core 3.x, & 2.x\n* .NET Framework 4.6\n\nOnline Guides :\n* Developer Guide : https://www.onbarcode.com/tutorial/csharp-barcode-reader.html\n* Contact US : support@onbarcode.com",
